<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="heading">我的好友码 <text class="code">{{friendCode || '加载中…'}}</text></view><view class="muted">把好友码分享给朋友，或输入对方好友码</view><view class="row add"><input class="input grow" type="number" maxlength="8" placeholder="输入 8 位好友码" value="{{code}}" bindinput="onCode"/><button class="button small" bindtap="add">添加</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{invites.length}}" class="card"><view class="heading">游戏邀请</view><view wx:for="{{invites}}" wx:key="room" class="item"><text class="grow">{{item.from}} 邀请你</text><button class="button small secondary" data-room="{{item.room}}" bindtap="acceptInvite">加入</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{requests.length}}" class="card"><view class="heading">好友申请</view><view wx:for="{{requests}}" wx:key="code" class="item"><text class="grow">{{item.name}} · {{item.code}}</text><button class="button small secondary" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="accept">接受</button></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="heading">好友 · {{friends.length}}</view><view wx:if="{{!friends.length}}" class="muted">还没有好友，邀请朋友一起玩吧</view><view wx:for="{{friends}}" wx:key="code" class="item"><view class="grow"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="presence {{item.online ? 'online' : ''}}"><text class="dot"/>{{item.online ? '在线' : '离线'}}</view></view><button class="button small secondary" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="invite">邀请游戏</button><button class="remove" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view></view>
